  "resource_templates": [
    {
      "uriTemplate": "gooddesign://projects/{project_id}/revisions/{revision}/archive",
      "name": "versioned_project_archive",
      "mimeType": "application/json"
    },
    {
      "uriTemplate": "gooddesign://projects/{project_id}/revisions/{revision}/quality",
      "name": "versioned_quality_assessment",
      "mimeType": "application/json"
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "候选URI，当前不可通过MCP读取。",
    "所有读取和版本比较按服务器身份授权；不接受调用方自报角色。",
    "revision表示内容修订，schema_version表示字段合同；搜索结果为每项返回具体版本。",
    "data随工具采用受约束的项目摘要/记录/片段/质量/修订/差异对象；每工具详细data Schema仍待实现阶段冻结。",
    "事实、来源陈述、平台分析与审核状态都需返回；第三方不能据候选结果推断正式归属。",
    "首次只读，写入另经提议-审核-发布；本文件不是可直接运行的MCP配置。"
  ],
  "references": [
    "https://modelcontextprotocol.io/specification/2025-11-25/server/tools",
    "https://modelcontextprotocol.io/specification/2025-11-25/server/resources",
    "https://modelcontextprotocol.io/specification/2025-11-25/basic/authorization"
  ]
